sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant K as Kafka
  participant P as Payment
  participant L as Ledger (in Payment)
  participant J as Settlement job
  participant PO as Payout provider
  K--)P: PaymentSucceeded
  P->>L: debit customer payments, credit seller payable, commission, fees
  P->>P: GST invoice per seller order (CGST+SGST or IGST), PDF to storage
  P--)K: InvoiceGenerated
  K--)P: OrderDelivered
  P->>P: hold until the return window closes
  Note over P: window closed and no open return: amount becomes payable
  J->>J: run on the settlement cycle (locked, idempotent)
  J->>L: per seller: payable - commission - fees - TCS - TDS - refunds
  J->>P: settlement + settlement_items
  J->>PO: payout
  PO-->>J: completed
  J->>L: debit seller payable, credit payouts
  J--)K: PayoutCompleted
